{
    "dialogue": [
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 20:59:58",
            "content": "こんばんは。今日はよろしくお願いします。",
            "English": "Good evening. Thank you for being here today."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:00:11",
            "content": "よろしくお願いいたします",
            "English": "Thank you for having me."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:00:27",
            "content": "始めさせていただいてもよろしいでしょうか？",
            "English": "Shall we begin?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:00:31",
            "content": "はい",
            "English": "Yes."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:01:17",
            "content": "こんばんは。相談員です。今日はどんなご相談でしょうか？",
            "English": "Good evening. I’m the counselor. What would you like to talk about today?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:01:33",
            "content": "死にたい",
            "English": "I want to die."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:02:54",
            "content": "死にたいと思っておられるんですねそう思うほど、きっと辛いことがあったんでしょうね",
            "English": "You're feeling like you want to die. For you to feel that way, something very painful must have happened."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:03:36",
            "content": "まだ話していませんがそんなかんじです",
            "English": "I haven't talked about it yet, but that's how it feels."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:03:39",
            "content": "良かったら、お話を聞かせてもらえませんか？",
            "English": "If you’re comfortable, would you mind telling me about it?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:04:33",
            "content": "友達に見捨てられた",
            "English": "I was abandoned by my friend."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:04:41",
            "content": "あれだけ信じていたのに",
            "English": "Even though I trusted them so much."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:04:57",
            "content": "誰も信じられない",
            "English": "I can't trust anyone anymore."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:05:19",
            "content": "そうなんですね信じてたのに・・・それはひどいですね",
            "English": "I see. You trusted them, and yet... That’s really hurtful."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:05:48",
            "content": "友達だと思っていた",
            "English": "I thought we were friends."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:05:55",
            "content": "でももう違う",
            "English": "But not anymore."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:05:56",
            "content": "うんうん",
            "English": "Mmm-hmm."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:06:05",
            "content": "もうわからない",
            "English": "I don't understand anymore."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:06:51",
            "content": "分からない？",
            "English": "You don't understand?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:07:07",
            "content": "生きる意味がわからない",
            "English": "I don't understand the meaning of living."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:08:02",
            "content": "そう思っておられるんですね友だちに裏切られた気持ちでいっぱいで、悔しいですね",
            "English": "That’s how you’re feeling. You're filled with feelings of betrayal by your friend, and it's so upsetting."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:08:15",
            "content": "裏切られた",
            "English": "Betrayed."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:08:17",
            "content": "そう",
            "English": "Yes."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:08:30",
            "content": "そうなんですね",
            "English": "I see."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:08:50",
            "content": "その友達はどんな友達でしたか？",
            "English": "What kind of friend were they to you?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:08:59",
            "content": "親友",
            "English": "My best friend."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:09:24",
            "content": "そうだったんですね親友だったら、余計に許せないですね",
            "English": "I see. If they were your best friend, it must be even harder to forgive."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:09:35",
            "content": "ゆるせない",
            "English": "I can’t forgive them."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:09:48",
            "content": "かなしい",
            "English": "I'm sad."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:10:08",
            "content": "ショックだし、すごく悲しいですね",
            "English": "It’s a shock, and it’s incredibly sad."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:10:40",
            "content": "生きていられない",
            "English": "I can't go on living."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:10:43",
            "content": "良かったら、どんなことがあったか教えていただけませんか？",
            "English": "If you’re willing, could you tell me what happened?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:11:46",
            "content": "最高の親友だと思ってたのに",
            "English": "I thought they were my absolute best friend."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:11:54",
            "content": "その子は他の子が親友だと",
            "English": "But they considered someone else their best friend."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:11:55",
            "content": "思ってた",
            "English": "That’s what they thought."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:11:58",
            "content": "しんどい",
            "English": "It's so hard."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:12:02",
            "content": "裏切られた",
            "English": "I was betrayed."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:12:04",
            "content": "生きていられないと感じるほど、あなたは傷ついていているんですね",
            "English": "You’re hurt so deeply that you feel you can’t go on living."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:12:34",
            "content": "傷ついてる、そう",
            "English": "I'm hurting, yes."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:12:43",
            "content": "つらいですね",
            "English": "That must be painful."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:12:44",
            "content": "リスカもしてる",
            "English": "I've been cutting myself, too."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:13:14",
            "content": "いつからですか？今？",
            "English": "Since when? Right now?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:13:19",
            "content": "今",
            "English": "Right now."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:14:09",
            "content": "傷口はどう？？出血は多いの？？？",
            "English": "How is the wound? Is it bleeding a lot?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:14:17",
            "content": "血はない",
            "English": "There's no blood."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:14:21",
            "content": "体調は大丈夫？？",
            "English": "Are you feeling okay physically?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:14:32",
            "content": "平気",
            "English": "I’m fine."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:15:05",
            "content": "良かった・・出血ないんですね傷だけですか？？",
            "English": "That's a relief... So there's no bleeding? Just a cut?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:15:10",
            "content": "はい",
            "English": "Yes."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:16:31",
            "content": "良かった・・・ホッしました。あなたが無事でよかったです。リスカは初めてかな？今までもあるのかな？",
            "English": "I’m glad… that’s a relief. I’m glad you’re safe. Is this your first time cutting, or have you done it before?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:16:47",
            "content": "今までもある",
            "English": "I’ve done it before."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:16:55",
            "content": "嫌な時あったり",
            "English": "When things get rough."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:17:04",
            "content": "みんなしてる",
            "English": "Everyone does it."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:17:07",
            "content": "うんうん",
            "English": "Mmm-hmm."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:17:16",
            "content": "え？みんな？",
            "English": "Hm? Everyone?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:17:35",
            "content": "うん",
            "English": "Yeah."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:17:49",
            "content": "みんなって誰ですか？",
            "English": "Who do you mean by “everyone”?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:17:59",
            "content": "知り合い",
            "English": "Acquaintances."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:18:36",
            "content": "友だちではなくて、しりあいなんだどんな知り合い？",
            "English": "So not friends, but acquaintances—what kind of acquaintances are they?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:18:49",
            "content": "学校",
            "English": "From school."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:19:50",
            "content": "学校の知り合いなんだね。今、何年生？？",
            "English": "Acquaintances from school, I see. What grade are you in?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:20:29",
            "content": "高２",
            "English": "Second year of high school."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:22:35",
            "content": "高２なんだね学校はどんな感じ？",
            "English": "Second year, I see. What's school like?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:23:19",
            "content": "どんな感じ、、",
            "English": "What do you mean, what's it like…?"
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:24:19",
            "content": "お返事しにくいかな",
            "English": "Is that a difficult question to answer?"
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:26:17",
            "content": "話すのが難しいなら話さなくても大丈夫です",
            "English": "If it’s hard to talk about, you don’t have to."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:26:50",
            "content": "そういうことではありません",
            "English": "That’s not what I meant."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:28:35",
            "content": "そうなんですね分かりにくかったかもしれないですね。学校ではどう過ごしているのかな？",
            "English": "I see. Perhaps my question was unclear. How do you spend your time at school?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:28:47",
            "content": "普通に過ごしてます",
            "English": "I spend it normally."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:28:55",
            "content": "普通って？",
            "English": "What do you mean by “normally”?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:29:27",
            "content": "普通は普通です",
            "English": "Normal is normal."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:31:15",
            "content": "普通って言われても、人によって普通はひとりひとり違うから、難しいね",
            "English": "Even when we say “normal,” it can mean something different for each person, so it’s a bit hard to tell."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:31:42",
            "content": "どういうことですか",
            "English": "What do you mean?"
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:32:49",
            "content": "「普通」って、人によって違うよね。あなたはどう思いますか？",
            "English": "“Normal” varies from person to person. What does it mean to you?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:35:09",
            "content": "なんでその質問をするんですか",
            "English": "Why are you asking that question?"
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:36:39",
            "content": "あなたが思う普通って、どんなのかな～と思って、聞いてみました。",
            "English": "I asked because I was wondering what “normal” is like for you."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:37:02",
            "content": "それ聞いてどうするんですか",
            "English": "And what are you going to do with that?"
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:37:27",
            "content": "無理に答えることはないので",
            "English": "You don't have to force yourself to answer."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:37:43",
            "content": "話したくないなら話さなくて大丈夫です",
            "English": "If you’d rather not talk about it, that’s okay."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:38:11",
            "content": "ここではあなたが話したいことを話してもらえたら大丈夫です",
            "English": "Here, you can talk about whatever you want to."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:38:17",
            "content": "私のせいですね",
            "English": "It’s my fault, isn’t it?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:38:20",
            "content": "だめですね",
            "English": "I’m no good."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:38:31",
            "content": "あなたのせい？",
            "English": "Your fault?"
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:38:37",
            "content": "だめ？",
            "English": "No good?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:38:39",
            "content": "余計なこと言ったから",
            "English": "Because I said something I shouldn't have."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:38:45",
            "content": "もういいです",
            "English": "Never mind."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:39:21",
            "content": "何も余計なことは言ってないです",
            "English": "You haven’t said anything you shouldn't have."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:40:07",
            "content": "こちらこそ、話したくないことを聞いてしまったんですね",
            "English": "If anything, it was me who asked about something you didn't want to talk about."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:40:38",
            "content": "もういいです私が悪いので",
            "English": "Never mind, it's my fault."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:42:44",
            "content": "そんなことはないです。あなたは何も悪くありません。",
            "English": "That’s not true. You haven’t done anything wrong."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:45:31",
            "content": "どうしましょうか。このまま、お話続けられますか？",
            "English": "What would you like to do? Would you like to continue talking?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:48:59",
            "content": "しんどいんでやめます",
            "English": "This is too hard, so I'll stop."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:52:37",
            "content": "そうなんですね。分かりました。今日は辛い気持ちの中、ここにくれて本当にありがとうございました。最後にあなたに伝えたいことがあるので、お伝えしてもいいでしょうか？",
            "English": "I see. I understand. Thank you so much for coming here today while feeling so much pain. There's one last thing I'd like to say to you, may I?"
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:52:55",
            "content": "はい",
            "English": "Yes."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 21:56:57",
            "content": "あなたがここに来てくれて、辛い気持ちを少しでも話してくれたこと、本当に感謝しています。親友だった友達から裏切られ、絶望を感じて死にたいと思うのは当たり前です。あなただけでなく、誰でも死にたくなります。",
            "English": "I'm truly grateful that you came here and shared even a little of your painful feelings. It's completely natural to feel despair and want to die after being betrayed by someone who was your best friend. It's not just you; anyone would feel like dying in that situation."
        },
        {
            "role": "クライアント",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 22:04:00",
            "content": "(すみませんそろそろ時間なので失礼します、ロープレありがとうございました。いつでも終了して構いません)",
            "English": "(I’m sorry, it’s about time, so I’ll excuse myself. Thank you for the role-play. Please feel free to end at any time.)"
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 22:04:04",
            "content": "あなた受けた心の傷は、きっと深くて大きいものだと思います。想像を絶する辛さなのではないでしょうか",
            "English": "The emotional wound you've received must be very deep and large. The pain must be unimaginable."
        },
        {
            "role": "カウンセラー",
            "time": "2021/05/25(火) 22:05:40",
